                            <comment id="13088693" author="gsingers" created="Mon, 22 Aug 2011 13:42:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Removes the S3 downloading, assumes you have the mail files local or in HDFS already.  This should actually work on any mbox files.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13090287" author="hudson" created="Wed, 24 Aug 2011 15:17:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Integrated in Mahout-Quality #1000 (See &lt;a href=&quot;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/1000/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/1000/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;
